# Cloudflare Pages Redirects Configuration
# Proxy API requests to Render backend

# API proxy - redirect all /api/* requests to Render backend
/api/*  https://photos-poc.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

# Health check proxy
/health  https://photos-poc.onrender.com/health  200

# SPA fallback - serve index.html for all other routes
/*  /index.html  200
